should not be independently hardcoded in two places"],"finding":"Tier-2 derives the G3/G4 container split by re-checking 'membership in the (small, hardcoded in run_pass1) G3/G4 container set' — but the plan does not state that Tier-2 IMPORTS/shares run_pass1's set rather than hardcoding its own copy, creating a silent-drift coupling if run_pass1's container set changes.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"fdd3f70ca53644a9a","impact":0.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"Context 'Tier-2 derives its own single/agent/container split the same way'; Approach single-criterion mode 'with G3/G4's container split applied same as run_pass1'","norm_id":"n58f24ea5028acd92","priority":0.0,"reason":"veto:absence-refuted","recalled":false,"scenarios":["run_pass1 later adds G5 to its container set; Tier-2's own hardcoded copy is not updated, so Tier-2 mis-dispatches G5 and its finding-set comparison diverges from production silently"],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"Expose run_pass1's G3/G4 container membership as an importable constant/helper and have Tier-2 consume it directly.","tier":"LLM","validity":0.2222,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"no","asserted_capability_confirmed":"no","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"no","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"no","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"no","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"no"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"none","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"low","prod_impact":"none","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"none"}}},{"block_threshold":0.95,"blocking_enabled":false,"checklist_item":"- [ ] State a budget guard for AGENT-tier `--criteria` runs (an abort/confirm threshold on the pre-flight estimate), even though no fixed per-sample ceiling is asserted.","cohort":["COH","E1","E2","E6","F1","T2","T4","T5a","T5e","T7"],"criteria":["T5a"],"decision":"dropped","decision_margin":-0.95,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["'no fixed per-sample ceiling assumed'","'Budget pre-flight from stored per-criterion usage × current price' — an estimate is computed but the plan states no threshold at which the run aborts or requires confirmation","T5a cost/economics: an AGENT-tier criterion is an agentic per-sample LLM path; over the sample this is the dominant cost with no stated bound"],"finding":"For an AGENT-tier `--criteria` run the plan explicitly assumes 'no fixed per-sample ceiling', and the only stated cost control is a pre-flight estimate with no abort/confirm threshold — so an AGENT-tier single-criterion run over the sample has no stated spend guard beyond the one-time $60 commissioning cap.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f9df8f948df98b574","impact":0.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"Context 'AGENT-tier criteria ... cost their real production rate ... with no fixed per-sample ceiling assumed'; Approach 'Budget pre-flight from stored per-criterion usage × current price'","norm_id":"n2b5f1130a4dc49a2","priority":0.0,"reason":"veto:absence-refuted","recalled":false,"scenarios":["An operator runs `tier2 --criteria T8` (AGENT tier) over the sample after the ticket; the pre-flight estimates a large spend but nothing stops the run from proceeding to that cost"],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"Have the pre-flight require an explicit --budget flag (or interactive confirmation) when the estimated AGENT-tier spend exceeds a stated threshold.","tier":"LLM","validity":0.2222,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"no","asserted_capability_confirmed":"no","cited_r